                <invention-title lang="de">ABSTANDSELEMENT FÜR EINE WICKLUNG, KIT, VERFAHREN ZUR HERSTELLUNG EINER WICKLUNG UND WICKLUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">ÉLÉMENT D'ESPACEMENT POUR UN ENROULEMENT, KIT, PROCÉDÉ DE FABRICATION D'UN ENROULEMENT ET ENROULEMENT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SPACER ELEMENT FOR A WINDING, KIT, METHOD FOR MANUFACTURING A WINDING AND WINDING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>According to an embodiment, the spacer element (1) for a winding (100) of an electric device comprises at least one connection member (20, 21, 22) and a plurality of ribs (3). The ribs are connected to the connection member and are spaced from each other pairwise. The spacer element is arrangeable between two successive winding units (10) of the winding during manufacturing of the winding. Each two adjacent ribs delimit a flow channel (4) for a cooling fluid, said flow channel extends between and along the two adjacent ribs.</p>
            </abstract>
